## SQ-TIE-01 | census 96 at 4000 4000: falseNegatives 0, built equal to wgp_new, no reflection error
@group B
@commands Boot; `/cwglocate census 96` at the perf.md 10.9 center; read `kubejs/exported/worldgen/locate_census.json`; grep latest.log for `locate reflection` and `f_48435_`
@pass `falseNegatives` 0 in total, and 0 for `terralith:underground/old_refinery` and `mining_outpost` (were 4 and 6 at 162,270 / 157,199 / 240,325 and others); their `no.biome` drops by about that many; `built` per structure equal to `wgp_new` (generation unchanged); census time within noise of 424 s; no reflection error
@fails A false negative still at `biome`: the tie set misses the generated biome (another biome source wraps the multi-noise one, or a mod changes `getNoiseBiome`); at another stage: a new bug, read its row; reflection error: the SRG name of `MultiNoiseBiomeSource.parameters`
@from batches/r1103w/w_9_B.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-20
> cwglocate census 96 4000 4000
waitlog \[(celocate|cwglocate)\] census done 2400
shell mkdir -p $INST/perf/runs/r1103w/w && cp kubejs/exported/worldgen/locate_census.json $INST/perf/runs/r1103w/w/f1_census_tie.json && echo copied f1_census_tie
reject (?i)locate reflection
bootreject (?i)locate reflection
bootreject f_48435_
shell python3 -c "import json; a=json.load(open('$INST/perf/runs/r1103w/w/f1_census_tie.json')); b=json.load(open('$INST/perf/wgp/wgp_new/locate_census.json')); print('seconds', a['seconds'], 'vs', b['seconds'], '; falseNegatives', a['falseNegatives'], 'vs', b['falseNegatives']); B={s['structure']:s for s in b['structures']}; diff=[(s['structure'], s['built'], B[s['structure']]['built']) for s in a['structures'] if s['structure'] in B and s['built']!=B[s['structure']]['built']]; print(len(diff), 'structures with a different built count'); [print(' ', d) for d in diff[:30]]; [print(s['structure'], 'fn', s['falseNegatives'], 'no.biome', s['predictedNo']['biome'], 'was', B.get(s['structure'],{}).get('predictedNo',{}).get('biome')) for s in a['structures'] if s['structure'].endswith(('old_refinery','mining_outpost'))]; exit(0 if a['falseNegatives']==0 else 1)"
look built per structure equal to wgp_new (generation unchanged; 6 structures differed by 1-5 between wgp_old and wgp_new from options 2 and 4, same here is fine); census time within noise of 424 s

